{'symbol': 'BK', 'date': '2023-02-13 16:15:00', 'title': 'BNY MELLON TO SPEAK AT THE RBC CAPITAL MARKETS GLOBAL FINANCIAL INSTITUTIONS CONFERENCE', 'text': 'NEW YORK , FEB. 13, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE BANK OF NEW YORK MELLON CORPORATION ("BNY MELLON") (NYSE: BK) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ROBIN VINCE, PRESIDENT AND CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER, WILL SPEAK AT THE RBC CAPITAL MARKETS GLOBAL FINANCIAL INSTITUTIONS CONFERENCE, IN NEW YORK, AT 4:00 P.M. ET ON TUESDAY, MARCH 7, 2023.'}